# Example ReRDMFT input file: carbon monoxide, using the cc-pVTZ basis
# (downloaded from https://www.basissetexchange.org/), which includes D and
# F shells for both atoms (see co-cc-pvtz.gbs). NON_RELATIVISTIC only --
# no C4_SPINOR here, since this basis is far too large for the RKB
# two-electron tensor (nLarge=70, nSmall=224; see co-cc-pvdz.inp and
# co-sto-3g.inp for C4_SPINOR examples instead).
NELEC 14
BASIS co-cc-pvtz.gbs
NON_RELATIVISTIC TRUE

GEOMETRY
C   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
O   0.000000   0.000000   1.128000
END
